27q2.htm"}, {"d": "2025-05-15", "n": 1.56, "z": null, "rz": -1.5, "earn": true, "q": "Given the dynamic nature of the backdrop, and the range of near-term outcomes being exceedingly wide and difficult to predict, we felt it best to hold from providing a specific range of guidance for operating income growth and EPS for the second quarter. With a longer view into the full year, we believe we can navigate…", "a": "said John David Rainey, Walmart Inc. executive vice president and chief financial officer", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/104169/000010416925000069/earningsreleasefy26q1.htm"}, {"d": "2025-04-09", "n": 6.58, "z": null, "rz": null, "earn": false, "q": "The combination of a purpose-driven, people-centric culture with world-class technology is the winning formula,", "a": "said Doug McMillon, president and CEO of Walmart Inc", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/104169/000010416925000036/pressrelease4925.htm"}, {"d": "2024-01-31", "n": 1.39, "z": null, "rz": null, "earn": false, "q": "Sam Walton believed it was important to keep our share price in a range where purchasing whole shares, rather than fractions, was accessible to all of our associates,", "a": "said Doug McMillon, President and CEO of Walmart", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/104169/000010416924000004/pressrelease1302024.htm"}, {"d": "2023-04-04", "n": 3.35, "z": null, "rz": null, "earn": false, "q": "We are in a unique position to serve our customers and members however they want to shop, which will fuel continued growth,", "a": "said Doug McMillon, Walmart president and chief executive officer", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/104169/000010416923000026/exhibit991-8xk442023.htm"}, {"d": "2022-12-23", "n": 5.22, "z": null, "rz": null, "earn": false, "q": "Flipkart and PhonePe are proud, homegrown Indian brands with a user base upwards of 400 million each. We are looking forward to the next phase of our growth as we invest in new business-like insurance, wealth management and lending, while also enabling the next wave of growth for UPI payments in India. This will help p…", "a": "Sameer Nigam, Founder and CEO at PhonePe, said", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/104169/000010416922000088/exhibit991-pressrelease122.htm"}], "now": null}, "score": {"value": 39, "verdict": {"it": "Leggermente ribassista", "en": "Mildly bearish"}, "confidence": "Media", "covered_pct": 80, "missing": ["guid"], "subs": [{"id": "insider", "name": {"it": "Insider", "en": "Insiders"}, "w": 35, "v": 32, "why": [{"it": "Nessun acquisto discrezionale negli ultimi 90 giorni.", "en": "No discretionary purchase in the last 90 days."}, {"it": "Un dirigente apicale ha venduto in modo discrezionale.", "en": "A top executive sold at their own discretion."}, {"it": "Flusso netto pesato sullo storico: -3.41 M$.", "en": "Net flow weighted by track record: -3.41 M$."}, {"it": "41 operazioni escluse perché non informative (piani 10b5-1, ritenute fiscali, esercizi e assegnazioni).", "en": "41 transactions excluded as uninformative (10b5-1 plans, tax withholding, exercises and awards)."}], "coverage": "Alta"}, {"id": "guid", "name": {"it": "Guidance e tono", "en": "Guidance and tone"}, "w": 20, "v": null, "why": [{"it": "Serve l'export delle trascrizioni delle call.", "en": "Needs the export of the earnings-call transcripts."}], "coverage": "Assente"}, {"id": "market", "name": {"it": "Mercato", "en": "Market"}, "w": 15, "v": 36, "why": [{"it": "Short interest a 83.4 milioni di azioni, +10.5% rispetto alla mediana dell'ultimo anno (75.4 milioni).", "en": "Short interest at 83.4 million shares, +10.5% against the median of the last year (75.4 million)."}, {"it": "Sono il 1.05% delle azioni in circolazione (7934 milioni, fonte SEC).", "en": "That is 1.05% of shares outstanding (7934 million, source SEC)."}, {"it": "Negli ultimi tre mesi è salito del 32.2% (dal 2026-08-14).", "en": "Over the last three months it has risen by 32.2% (sin